**game.hpp maps game-engine symbols and declares runtime APIs.**

## Interface

`mp_dll: HMODULE`; `game_offset(uintptr_t): uintptr_t`.

`symbol<T>` wraps an address as `T*`, exposing `get()`, conversion, and `operator->()`.

`Cbuf_AddText(int,const char*)`; `CL_KeyEvent(int,int,int,unsigned int)`; `Cmd_AddCommandInternal(const char*,void(__cdecl*)(),cmd_function_s*)`.

`DB_IsXAssetDefault(XAssetType,const char*): bool`; `DB_EnumXAssetEntries(XAssetType,std::function<void(XAssetEntryPoolEntry*)>,bool)`; `DB_GetXAssetName(game::XAsset*): const char*`.

`ScrPlace_GetViewPlacement(): ScreenPlacement`; `R_RegisterFont(const char*): Font_s*`; `Material_RegisterHandle(const char*): Material*`.

`Dvar_FindVar(const char*): dvar_s*`; `Dvar_SetString`; `Dvar_RegisterBool`; `GamerProfile_UpdateProfileFromDvars`; `Live_UpdateClan`.

`Scr_GetFunctionHandle`; `RemoveRefToObject`; `Scr_ExecThread`; `Scr_LoadScript`; `Scr_GetNumParam`.

## Coupling

`structs.hpp` supplies engine types; `symbols.hpp` supplies symbol bindings.